From 71e7d7bb9e823f0494df27ef64fcd3407aa76191 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 21:37:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ZHOME-200: after the 1203 drive home a Z axis moves 200
 pulses in the home direction at HomeLowSpeed -- MachineType.h
 W906_Z_HOME_BACKOFF_PULSE
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 1002「Z軸歸原點我需要更改動作 不是往回找home偵測到停下 是往回 200 就好」, his picks: the SAME
direction as the home search (Mot_Table HomeDirectior), 200 pulses, HomeLowSpeed. Every axis still homes
with the drive (Acm_AxHome 124/128, the drive sets the origin); only a Z axis -- alias ending in Z or Z+one
char (Motor/EcatMotorRoute.h W906_IsZAxisAlias: MLoaderZ, MEmptyZ, MAuto1-3Z, MInArmZA, MOutArmZA,
MTestZ1) -- then moves the back-off, and the home ends when that move is done.
  * Motor Test single HOME (WebMotorAccess.cpp TickHomes): new phase 2 after READY-after-HOMING:
    SetSpeed Init/Run = HomeLowSpeed, kCmdAxMoveRel(+-200), done = READY on a fresh sample with the
    command position at the target (+-2); door open -> stop, HomeFlag=2; timeout -> HomeFlag=2; then
    the home seed Run speed again and an arm Z goes to ZSafePos (phase 1) as before.
    g_W906ZHomeBackoff (pure module), set at boot by WebMotorAccessLive.cpp from the macro.
  * Engine HOME (Motor/myEthercatmotor.cpp EtherCatMotHome #else, the route): case 20 issues
    W906_EcSetSpeed(low, low) + kEcMoveRel and goes to new Task 30, which returns true on MotionDone()
    (never from a pending sample); TMyMotor::Home sets TMyEtherCatMotor::iW906ZHomeBackoff from the
    alias. MotorHome's 90 s ResetTime bounds it.
  ! golden's own home pitch (mySYNTEKmotor.cpp:684-692, iHomePitch=200 from TMyMotor::Home) moves the
    OPPOSITE way; a negative W906_Z_HOME_BACKOFF_PULSE does that. Comment the #define out = no move.
  MTestZ1 in the engine homes through the Index Z1 route only with WB_ENGINE_INDEXZ_1203 (off) -- not changed.

tests/test_web_motor_access.cpp: + ZHOME-200 block (SetSpeed x2 + MoveRel +-200, waits, then ZSafePos, HomeFlag=1).
o2: wb_serve + test_web_motor_access + test_pci1203_motor_route build; ctest WebMotorAccess, Pci1203MotorRoute pass.
